 no-outbound-without-approval boundary for #2556. |\\n| 2556 | vessel-contractor-brochure-send-tracker | `docs/plans/2026-04-29-issue-2556-vessel-contractor-brochure-send-tracker.md` | 2026-04-29 | draft | T2 | Weekly GTM-target child of #1669/#2016. Brochure-assembly + outbound send-tracker plan; consumes #2555 charts and #2554 contractor matrix. Outline at `docs/reports/gtm/2026-04-29-vessel-contractor-brochure-outline.md` (sections, 3 chart slots, proof slots, CTA contract, tier copy variants). Send-tracker schema at `docs/reports/gtm/2026-04-29-vessel-contractor-send-tracker-schema.md` defines public/private split \\u2014 public YAML carries zero PII, private companion is gitignored. Legal-sanity gate (per `BUSINESS_BRAIN.md`) blocks `SENT` transition without scan. No emails sent in this issue's scope. Status remains `draft` until cross-provider adversarial review evidence lands at `scripts/review/results/2026-04-29-plan-2556-{claude,codex,gemini}.md`. |\\n| 2557 | weekly-productivity-flow-hacks | `docs/plans/2026-04-29-issue-2557-weekly-productivity-flow-hacks.md` | 2026-04-29 | draft | T2 | Weekly Business Brain productivity-flow audit. Evidence-anchored against W18 provider-utilization (claude 6.6% / codex 0.4% / gemini 0.1%), 21-feed 12h-continuation outcome (zero GitHub mutations), and #2374 plan-review auto-cycle (feeds 16-21). Companion report `docs/reports/2026-04-29-weekly-productivity-flow-hacks.md` ranks 14 hacks across 4 dimensions (GTM throughput, engineering throughput, agent orchestration, context/handoff hygiene) in 3 effort tiers (5 Immediate, 4 This-week, 5 Structural); top-3 priorities (H1 codex-cli 0.123 pin / H2 drain-ready-queue pack / H4 comment-only command-pack auto-executor) flagged as runnable-without-further-owner-input. 9 follow-up issues queued as candidates, none filed. No labels mutated. Status remains `draft` until cross-provider adversarial review artifacts land at `scripts/review/results/2026-04-29-plan-2557-{claude,codex,gemini}.md` (Codex blocked by #2479). |\\n| 2560 | gtm-contractor-evidence-fill | `docs/plans/2026-04-30-issue-2560-gtm-contractor-evidence-fill.md` | 2026-04-30 | draft | T2 | Nightly immediate batch 4/5 GTM artifact-factory plan. No outreach; artifact/discovery/legal-scan scope only. Parent/dependency: #2554; downstream blocker for #2556; related #2016. |\\n| 2561 | fowt-mooring-screening-worked-example | `docs/plans/2026-04-30-issue-2561-fowt-mooring-screening-worked-example.md` | 2026-04-30 | draft | T2 | Nightly immediate batch 4/5 GTM artifact-factory plan. No outreach; artifact/discovery/legal-scan scope only. Parent/dependency: #2554; related #2016 and #2556. |\\n| 2562 | gom-niche-vessel-contractor-evidence-lane | `docs/plans/2026-04-30-issue-2562-gom-niche-vessel-contractor-evidence-lane.md` | 2026-04-30 | draft | T2 | Nightly immediate batch 4/5 GTM artifact-factory plan. No outreach; artifact/discovery/legal-scan scope only. Parent/dependency: #2554; related #2016 and #2556. |\\n| 2126 | markdown-conversion-qa | \\u2014 (plan delivered via GitHub issue comments) | 2026-04-26 | completed | T3 | Plan v6 executed. 137 tests (15 structural + 120 parametrized + 2 regression). Branch `exec/issue-2126-markdown-conversion-qa`. Delivered: 6-dim rubric scorers, 20-topic oracle fixture set, floor-occupancy gate, session-hook regression proofs (R1+R2). |\\n| 2563 | telegram-hermes | `docs/plans/2026-05-02-issue-2563-telegram-hermes.md` | 2026-05-02 | plan-review | T2 | Private single-user Telegram bot for Hermes mobile control. 3 phases: Phase 1 systemd-managed gateway with token-via-`~/.hermes/.env` and chat-ID allowlist; Phase 2 mobile guardrails (no `approval=off`, post-condition smoke); Phase 3 STT/TTS marked OPTIONAL. Gemini r1 MAJOR (token-in-URL via `ps`/history exposure, `EnvironmentFile=-` leading-dash wrong, direct unit edit eaten by `hermes update`, missing post-condition assertion) addressed in r2 via `systemctl edit` drop-in + history-disabled subshell. Claude r1 MINOR concurs after revisions. Codex SKIPPED per #2479. |\\n| 2533 | mission-portfolio | `docs/plans/2026-05-02-issue-2533-mission-portfolio.md` | 2026-05-02 | plan-review | T3 | Portfolio-wide mission/objective row schema (repo, classification, mission, source-path, routing-rule-belongs-here, routing-rule-route-elsewhere, overlap-notes) plus 4 execution waves (Tier-1 alignment with #2460-#2465, Tier-2, Tier-3/archive, integration). Supersedes 2026-04-27 rev-5 plan. Gemini rev-1 \\u2192 rev-2 MAJOR addressed in rev-3 (Tier-1 keywords enumerated from `ROUTING_INDEX.md`, yq dependency declared, YAML\\u2192MD generation direction, symmetric `overlap_notes`). Codex SKIPPED per #2479. |\\n| 2532 | ci-guard-repair | `docs/plans/2026-05-02-issue-2532-ci-guard-repair.md` | 2026-05-02 | plan-review | T2 | Hardening + regression-detection layer over partial fix landed at `0e148288f` (2026-05-01). Failure 1 root cause: `src/workspace_hub/` is PEP-420 namespace package; `pyproject.toml` `include = [\\\"src*\\\"]` installs literal `src` not `workspace_hub`. Failure 2 root cause: `require-review-on-push.sh:15-19,138-142` uses `uv run --no-project python` for `int(time.time()*1000)` \\u2014 replaced with `date +%s%3N` / `python3` fallback. TDD test list per failure mode. Claude r1 MINOR (3+4 nits addressed inline); Gemini stream silent; r3 fallback concurs MINOR. Codex SKIPPED per #2479. |\\n| 2523 | hermes-preflight | `docs/plans/2026-05-02-issue-2523-hermes-preflight.md` | 2026-05-02 | plan-review | T2 | Reusable workstation preflight CLI (`scripts/preflight/hermes_preflight.py`, Python stdlib + argparse, no new deps). Mandatory `ssh ... bash -lc` for remote per #2519 finding. 27-row check matrix with role-aware severity (primary-dev block vs secondary-dev warn for `gh auth`); 7-rule redaction protocol with concrete `gho_...`\\u2192`[REDACTED:gh-token]` example; frozen JSON `schema_version: 1`; 4 mock fixtures + 20-test TDD list. Replaces ad-hoc `bash -lc` block in `docs/plans/machine-prompts/2026-04-27/ace-linux-2-continuous-parallel-work-prompt.md` lines 28-50. Gemini r1 MAJOR \\u2192 1 FP, 1 partial-true, 1 true; all addressed. Codex SKIPPED per #2479. Branch artifact also at `worktree-agent-a3925cd343bf6d44d`. |\\n| 2479 | codex-version-guard | `docs/plans/2026-05-02-issue-2479-codex-version-guard.md` | 2026-05-02 | plan-review | T2 | Floor-pin codex-cli at 0.123.0 (last upstream-confirmed good per [openai/codex#19945](https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/19945)) via `scripts/install/pin-codex.sh` + shared `scripts/install/codex-pin.env` wired into `new-machine-setup.sh` and `verify-setup.sh`. Runtime guard library (`scripts/review/lib/codex-version-guard.sh`) sourced by `submit-to-codex.sh` and `plan-review-fanout.sh`; new exit code 7 = INCOMPATIBLE_VERSION. Wrapper-half is already on main via #2518 (`021915337`, 2026-04-27); plan supersedes 2026-04-26 draft and explicitly does NOT merge stale `fix/codex-stdin-hang` branch. Live evidence: codex 0.128.0 still hangs on 90-byte prompt today (5-week unfixed regression). Gemini r1 MAJOR (4 findings F1-F4 alpha-bypass, `$LIB_DIR` undefined, PATH-on-bootstrap, `CODEX_PIN_VERSION` encapsulation) all patched. Codex SKIPPED (subject + broken). Already committed via worktree-merge in `bade0e6cc`. |\\n| 2626 | narrow-2552-runbook-fixes | `docs/plans/2026-05-03-issue-2626-narrow-2552-runbook-fixes.md` | 2026-05-03 | plan-review | T1 | Missing canonical plan recovered from dirty control checkout; 2026-05-04 Codex/Gemini MAJOR findings patched (marker claim, runbook sequencing, tests, #2552 regression contract); fresh rerun required before approval. |\\n| 2631 | llm-wiki-standards-routing-deferred-wikis | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2631-llm-wiki-standards-routing-deferred-wikis.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T1 | Decision-only plan for maritime-law / lng-projects / acma-projects standards-routing outcomes; no standards pages or enforcement code in scope. |\\n| 2632 | llm-wiki-approval-binding-rot-sweep | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2632-llm-wiki-approval-binding-rot-sweep.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T2 | Reconcile #2368/#2124/#2125 approval-binding rot without self-creating approval markers; implementation deliverables remain out of scope. |\\n| 2637 | llm-wiki-engineering-classification-societies | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2637-llm-wiki-engineering-classification-societies.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T2 | Engineering classification-society entity pages (DNV/ABS/LR/BV) from W1-C audit Table C item 8; entity summaries only, no raw standards copying. |\\n| 2638 | llm-wiki-marine-p1-standards-concepts | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2638-llm-wiki-marine-p1-standards-concepts.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T2 | Marine P1 standards directory/template plus motions-RAO and station-keeping concept backfill from W4-C Table G; source-stub volume untouched. |\\n| 2639 | llm-wiki-marine-p2-entities-overview | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2639-llm-wiki-marine-p2-entities-overview.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T2 | Marine P2 stability/platform entity backfill plus stale overview refresh from W4-C Table G; raw/source-stub provenance preserved. |\\n| 2643 | llm-wiki-rawlike-source-triage | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2643-llm-wiki-rawlike-source-triage.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T2 | Metadata-only `/mnt/ace-data` raw-like routing plan: frozen 14-root inventory, typed issue ownership mappings, duplicate-prevention checks, and no raw-content promotion. Links #2390/#2392/#2487 and routes AQWA/OrcaFlex/O&G standards to existing issue families. |\\n| 2644 | llm-wiki-offshore-raw-source-family-backfill | `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2644-llm-wiki-offshore-raw-source-family-backfill.md` | 2026-05-04 | plan-review | T2 | Bounded offshore source-family package plan for BSEE, HSE/safety, and Frontier Deepwater raw-like candidates. Depends on #2643 routing artifact, prohibits raw mount rescans, and requires sensitivity/approval gates before any derived summary promotion. |\\n\\n## Entry Format\\n\\nAdd one row per plan:\\n\\n```\\n| 1234 | short-slug | `docs/plans/2026-04-08-issue-1234-short-slug.md` | 2026-04-08 | plan-review | T2 | notes |\\n```\\n\\n## Notes for Agents\\n\\n- All plans go in `docs/plans/` \\u2014 never in `.hermes/plans/` or `.planning/phases/`\\n- Keep this README updated whenever a new plan is created or its status changes\\n- Batch execution agents must only act on issues marked `status:plan-approved`\\n- If a plan is revised materially, update the row and mark the older version `superseded`\\n- Never self-approve a plan \\u2014 the user or a designated operator must approve\\n\\n\\n\\n| [#2569](https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2569) | B1528 SIROCCO rudder source pack and benchmark extraction | [Plan](2026-05-01-issue-2569-b1528-sirocco-source-pack.md) | done | T2 | 2026-05-01 |\\n| [#2570](https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2570) | B1528 SIROCCO yaw-moment input and interactive static report | [Plan](2026-05-01-issue-2570-b1528-sirocco-yaw-moment-report.md) | done | T3 | 2026-05-01 |\\n| [#2571](https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2571) | B1528 SIROCCO time-trace benchmark report with rudder inflow feedback | [Plan](2026-05-01-issue-2571-b1528-sirocco-time-trace-report.md) | done | T3 | 2026-05-01 |\\n| 2656 | repo-structure-normalization | `docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-2656-repo-structure-normalization.md` | 2026-05-08 | plan-review | T3 | Repo-specific folder/file structure normalization plan; implementation blocked pending user approval. |\\n\", \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"sha\": \"36ee318ae1b2f004fd93102fd209bd89e18bd480\", \"display_url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/blob/main/docs/plans/README.md\", \"display_title\": \"README.md\"}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
